# three kits sound at once (engine.c NDL, the RAM): a fourth, however picked (here SEL's list), says "T4 SILENT 3 kits
# at most" and its Engine page's pads fade behind a box, SILENT, 3 kits at most (two themes' shots); it sounds once
# another kit changes engine (dl_rehome), and a kit made from a synth track then is the fourth again. T1 is a kit
wait 300
listen
param 2 0 8
param 3 0 8
wait 20
expect kitsilent 0
spin ALGO 3
expect trk 4
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
tap SEL
row ENGINE
turn ALGO 9 30
tap SEL
expect par4.0 8
wait 20
expect kitsilent 8
said T4 SILENT
wait 2200
shot kit4_silent.png
tap GLO
turn SELECT 8
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row THEME
turn ALGO 1
tap HOME
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
wait 100
shot kit4_silent_theme.png
# T2 a synth again: its unit goes to T4
param 2 0 0
wait 20
expect kitsilent 0
unsaid SILENT
param 2 0 8
wait 20
expect kitsilent 2
said T2 SILENT
